# One branch: main

This repository has **one** development branch: `main`. Work lands there directly. No PRs, no cleanup branches, no Cursor cloud branches.

- If `git branch --show-current` is not `main`, stop. Merge or move the work onto `main` before any other edit.
- Never `git checkout -b`, never push a side branch, never keep working on `playback-cleanup` or `cursor/*`.
